"description":"Tutorial 2: wheels and supply. Load a truck, carry supply to the front, bring up a recon car, and take the village at the end of the road.",
"winText":"The village is ours. You've learned to load and unload transports, to carry supply with you, and to use a recon car.",
"lossText":"We have nobody left to take the village. Try again: keep the squads near the supply truck, and let the recon car shoot first.",
